# proxy : dot access with identifiers passes String key to handler
# Until Phase 1 (integer dot access) is implemented, all dot access uses String keys
# p.foo, p.int_key, p.int_key_large all pass String keys
[
  handler: [fn [key] [type-of key]]
  p: [proxy handler]
  int_key: p.int_key
  int_key_large: p.int_key_large
  string_key: p.foo
]
=== out
Dict({"handler": Function(key), "p": Proxy, "int_key": String("String"), "int_key_large": String("String"), "string_key": String("String")})
=== warn
cannot unify Fn@? [String] with _t0 at 5:13-5:20
